OL,4,CVenezuela to scrap law that bars       
OL,5,Copposition from public office          
OL,6,GVenezuela will repeal a law that bars  
OL,7,Gopposition figures from assuming       
OL,8,Gpublic office, the speaker of the      
OL,9,GNational Assembly Jorge Rodriguez has  
OL,10,Gsaid.                                  
OL,12,FThe legislation, which was introduced  
OL,13,Ftwo years ago, has been criticised for 
OL,14,Fenabling political persecution, but    
OL,15,FRodriguez said no politician had been  
OL,16,Fsubjected to its provisions.           
OL,18,FThe older brother of Venezuela's       
OL,19,Finterim president Delcy Rodriguez said 
OL,20,Fhe expected the reforms to be approved 
OL,21,Fnext week.                             
